Description: ZFS-aware multi-panel duplicate-file deduplication tool for Linux
 DedupCommando is a Linux terminal UI for finding and safely deduplicating
 byte-for-byte identical files on ZFS pools (tested on Proxmox VE): a ZFS
 snapshot before each destructive batch, re-validation before acting, and a
 restorable quarantine. The installed command is `dedcom`.

